      "texte": "1) Calculons la longueur développée des fouilles en rigole :"
    },
    {
      "type": "calcul",
      "lignes": [
        "Ldf = Ldh + Ldv + Larc",
        "Ldh = 8,7 + 7,425",
        "Ldh = 16,125 m",
        "Ldv = 2,75 + 2,75 + 1,875",
        "Ldv = 7,375 m",
        "Larc = (2 * π * R) / 4",
